    "title": "db.Mobil App",
    "description": "Data acquisition in the stable: documents, farrowing, weaning and pregnancy checks are recorded directly in the stable and then transferred to the office db.Planer.\r\n\r\n- Always the perfect overview:\r\nThe sow card with the performance of the sow is on the phone at any time.\r\n\r\n- Input Support for documents:\r\nThe breed and origin of the Survey Ebers is automatically added from the Survey Eberdatei\r\n\r\n- Identification by barcode:\r\n(Required camera) with appropriate equipment can be called up via a barcode sows.\r\n\r\n- Monitoring insemination for the perfect assignment:\r\nEnter the occupation time quickly and easily in db.Mobil App and determine later in db.Planer the best time for optimum availability.\r\n\r\n- Pharmacopeia\r\nDetecting the drug consumption",
